## Middleware Filename

- **Keep filename as `src/middleware.ts`**
- Do NOT rename to `proxy.ts` even if Next.js 16+ suggests migration
- Export function must be: `export async function middleware(request: NextRequest)`

## Purpose

- Auth checks (magic link tokens, cookies)
- Route protection (`/barber/*`, `/admin/*`)
- Role-based access control
